How to use the concept of things being organic on the screen.\
\
Organic through shape\
Notes connect through curves instead of rigid visual constructions. Elements have gentle proportions and carefully softened edges. The interface can remain almost entirely flat.\
Organic through motion\
Animations respond to actual musical events. Notes settle into place, a harmony emerges when enabled, and playback creates a moving indicator. The movement is deliberate rather than decorative.\
Organic through relationships\
Musical elements visually influence one another. A melody and its harmony are shown together; selecting an interval highlights its corresponding notes; changing the melody updates the proposed harmony. The interface feels alive because the elements are connected.\
